  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Normal Skin</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A liquid brightening blush that seamlessly transitions color from the under-eyes to the cheeks.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This innovative product is the first step of your blush routine, made to bridge the gap between the under-eyes and the cheeks. Each brightening shade delivers a sheer boost of color at the perfect opacity. Silky, skin-like, and super-lightweight, the formula flows naturally into your signature blush.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply before Major Headlines Double-Take Cr&#232;me & Powder Blush Duo (sold separately).<br>-Place Major Skin Soft Blur Brightening Concealer (sold separately) on the inner corners of the eyes and the under-eyes. <br>-Add Liquid Transition Brightening Blush (sold separately) to the outer edge of your concealer. <br>-Blend the transition blush into the outer edge of your concealer using the dense end of the Dual-Ended Transition Blush Brush (sold separately), always using pressing motions. <br>-Finish blending the lighter concealer into the inner corners with the Major Skin 5-In-1 Blending Sponge (sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Aqua (Water) (Eau), Mica, Isononyl Isononanoate, Dimethicone, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, C13-15 Alkane, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Propanediol, Diisostearyl Malate, Dipentaerythrityl Hexahydroxystearate/Hexastearate/Hexarosinate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Peg-10 Dimethicone, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Magnesium Sulfate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Betaine, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Silica, Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol. May Contain (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492), Red 6 (Ci 15850), Red 7 Lake (Ci 15850), Red 28 Lake (Ci 45410), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Ultramarines (Ci 77007), Bismuth Oxychloride (Ci 77163).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Normal Skin</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A liquid brightening blush that seamlessly transitions color from the under-eyes to the cheeks.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This innovative product is the first step of your blush routine, made to bridge the gap between the under-eyes and the cheeks. Each brightening shade delivers a sheer boost of color at the perfect opacity. Silky, skin-like, and super-lightweight, the formula flows naturally into your signature blush.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply before Major Headlines Double-Take Cr&#232;me & Powder Blush Duo (sold separately).<br>-Place Major Skin Soft Blur Brightening Concealer (sold separately) on the inner corners of the eyes and the under-eyes. <br>-Add Liquid Transition Brightening Blush (sold separately) to the outer edge of your concealer. <br>-Blend the transition blush into the outer edge of your concealer using the dense end of the Dual-Ended Transition Blush Brush (sold separately), always using pressing motions. <br>-Finish blending the lighter concealer into the inner corners with the Major Skin 5-In-1 Blending Sponge (sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Aqua (Water) (Eau), Mica, Isononyl Isononanoate, Dimethicone, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, C13-15 Alkane, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Propanediol, Diisostearyl Malate, Dipentaerythrityl Hexahydroxystearate/Hexastearate/Hexarosinate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Peg-10 Dimethicone, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Magnesium Sulfate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Betaine, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Silica, Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol. May Contain (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492), Red 6 (Ci 15850), Red 7 Lake (Ci 15850), Red 28 Lake (Ci 45410), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Ultramarines (Ci 77007), Bismuth Oxychloride (Ci 77163).</div></details>",
